# Home Assistant templates

When editing Jinja / `value_template` / template entities in this repo:

1. Read and follow [`.cursor/skills/home-assistant-templates/SKILL.md`](../skills/home-assistant-templates/SKILL.md).
2. If you hit a new template quirk, **update that skill in the same change set** (see its “Maintain this skill” section).
